  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Independent Monitoring, Evaluation and Data Analysis (IMEDA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the effectiveness and targeting of humanitarian delivery in Yemen through the provision of independent oversight. The UK delivers humanitarian support on a large scale in Yemen, but due to the conflict, it has no staff in the country. This programme will check that programmes are delivering the intended benefits and help ensure that programmes provide a holistic range of support to those most in need.</narrative>
  </description>
